{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the reciprocals of the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/0561d206b22c2c257323a06ef53126f4e994d486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + bx + c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8279abddcf382c87aa621bdbdf4e8017616f6ceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac {1}{a} + \\frac {1}{b} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ - \\frac {c}{b} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ \\frac{b}{c}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\ -\\frac{a}{b}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ -\\frac{b}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"492\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, we can write the sum of the roots of any quadratic equation in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b6afb4302af4ccac3f72a6051b38e61b36b6e54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c6ab647b465ee283403c5992e8071b6621e40a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" />, and the product as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b84719dcd9659dc2554a5e6701617224a5af26b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots, then the sum of the reciprocals of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c623e021a37f4460e4fe09cdd47552e8f02431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r} + \\frac{1}{s} = \\frac{r+s}{rs}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"114\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Applying the formulas, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdfc64cdd6e1e3ddd3f3139ac396866a311c39bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{-b}{a}}{\\frac{c}{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"22\" height=\"47\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/c/fecafa4b197a724610161d1a24e5543665f1e626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {-b}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"28\" height=\"39\" /> =&gt; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/28969a57466b0a1047fca37478da706c1cb8cced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8af3ce59abb230739038f256db35ff60edd16583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2f(\\frac{1}{x})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3b8be31d9e21e92918f42cfaa7b324766d507b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bbfa9123af83cbff60798eb9ec8fed622fffed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe682a677b45cd7c227e641a1113ecf056c46f64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2f(\\frac{1}{x})=cx^2+bx+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b1086c23fee19289b8c1d3d72a439e6af6b092e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{r}+\\frac{1}{s}=\\boxed{\\frac{-b}{c}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"112\" height=\"50\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a h